WEBVTT

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:11.173
Ow!

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:13.178
I never heard of a marionette
that sleeps at night...

00:00:13.246 --> 00:00:15.681
...or thrashes and snores.

00:00:15.748 --> 00:00:17.910
Man... What's the deal?!

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:25.280
What was she doing in an
underground capsule, anyways?

00:00:54.153 --> 00:00:57.350
| came to this land to protect you.

00:00:57.724 --> 00:01:00.955
| was born to be with you.

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:04.194
The moment I awoke...

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:08.390
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:11.868
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:12.238 --> 00:01:15.674
I was born to hold you.

00:01:15.875 --> 00:01:18.810
Lies and truths...

00:01:19.445 --> 00:01:22.972
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:23.850 --> 00:01:27.616
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:29.622
...won't get to me.

00:01:29.989 --> 00:01:33.186
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:33.559 --> 00:01:36.654
...can be ours once again!

00:01:37.030 --> 00:01:41.263
Day in, day out,
like a puppet on a string.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:45.100
Wandering in the void
between zero and infinity.

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.505
The strength to sever
the tangled wires...

00:01:48.574 --> 00:01:53.239
...is still sleeping inside of you.

00:02:03.456 --> 00:02:06.050
If you fully remember the
last episode, forgive me!

00:02:06.125 --> 00:02:09.925
Last time, our totally cool
lead character, Otaru Mamiya...

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:13.330
...had a dramatic first encounter
with his new marionette!

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:16.926
<i>But this marionette girlie a
bit different from the others.</i>

00:02:17.003 --> 00:02:18.835
Her name is Lime,
her heart is light...

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:21.169
...her disposition is sunny,
her naivete is unsurpassed...

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.334
...and her heart's set for LOVE!

00:02:23.409 --> 00:02:24.968
Otaru, you poor lovesick fool!

00:02:25.044 --> 00:02:27.775
What will you do?
What CAN you do??!

00:02:27.847 --> 00:02:31.960
But enough! This episode
is now in session!!

00:02:31.984 --> 00:02:37.150
Marionette Girl:
The Troublemaker

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:39.150
"Nihachi Noodles"

00:02:46.132 --> 00:02:47.122
What was that?!

00:03:15.128 --> 00:03:17.495
A new group of robbers?!

00:03:17.997 --> 00:03:22.059
Yes, sir. They struck five times
last night in the shopping district.

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:24.797
They used explosives.
Quite a violent approach.

00:03:25.805 --> 00:03:28.240
Have you discovered
their identity?

00:03:28.307 --> 00:03:30.401
We have no positive
proof yet, however...

00:03:30.476 --> 00:03:32.467
Well? Tell me!

00:03:33.379 --> 00:03:35.905
We believe they
are from Gartlant.

00:03:35.982 --> 00:03:37.541
What?!

00:03:37.617 --> 00:03:39.676
The explosives they used
are definitely the same...

00:03:39.752 --> 00:03:41.686
...as those used by
the Gartlant army.

00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:43.222
My God...

00:03:43.289 --> 00:03:46.020
We can't rely on
fire fighters for this.

00:03:46.159 --> 00:03:48.127
You two! Track down the thieves!

00:03:48.194 --> 00:03:49.025
Sir!

00:03:50.997 --> 00:03:54.194
Shogun... Do you suppose
this is Faust's doing?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:57.526
Old man, I want more food.

00:03:57.603 --> 00:03:58.468
M'lord?

00:03:58.538 --> 00:04:01.405
The koi look hungry.

00:04:01.474 --> 00:04:03.067
Shogun?!

00:04:03.142 --> 00:04:07.170
Don't lose your head.
Haste only creates waste.

00:04:08.247 --> 00:04:10.215
Now go bring me that fish food.

00:04:10.283 --> 00:04:11.751
Yes, m'Lord.

00:04:15.621 --> 00:04:17.715
Faust...

00:04:26.199 --> 00:04:28.167
What's the meaning of this?!

00:04:30.937 --> 00:04:32.803
Good morning, Otaru!

00:04:32.872 --> 00:04:35.068
Lime! Give me a break!

00:04:35.141 --> 00:04:37.075
You don't just go
breaking down doors!

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:40.704
Oh, no!
The door frame is wrecked, too!

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:43.806
Holy crap! You've even
cracked the wall!

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:44.714
Lime...!

00:04:45.885 --> 00:04:48.411
| guess I put too
much OOMPH into it.

00:04:48.621 --> 00:04:50.111
OOMPH, my ass!

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:52.718
Don't forget! You're
not paying to live here!

00:04:52.792 --> 00:04:56.422
I want you to start thinking
before you do ANYTHING!

00:04:56.495 --> 00:04:58.463
Hey, Otaru. You hungry?

00:04:59.832 --> 00:05:01.766
Well, yeah... A little...

00:05:01.834 --> 00:05:03.893
HEY! I'm talking to you!!

00:05:04.103 --> 00:05:05.571
Ta-dah!

00:05:07.306 --> 00:05:09.502
I brought you your breakfast!

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:12.478
Doesn't it look GOOD?

00:05:13.379 --> 00:05:15.074
I can't tell.

00:05:15.414 --> 00:05:17.246
Lime... What is this?

00:05:17.316 --> 00:05:18.408
"Break-fast."

00:05:18.484 --> 00:05:19.781
I KNOW THAT!

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:22.753
| mean, where did
you get it?!

00:05:22.822 --> 00:05:24.381
Um...

00:05:24.457 --> 00:05:26.289
From there, there...

00:05:26.359 --> 00:05:28.237
...there, and over there.

00:05:28.261 --> 00:05:29.854
- Oh, no...
...there, and over there.

00:05:29.929 --> 00:05:31.693
OTARU!

00:05:34.166 --> 00:05:36.760
So YOU'RE the one
with the marionette!

00:05:36.836 --> 00:05:38.998
You instructed her to
steal our breakfasts?!

00:05:39.071 --> 00:05:40.163
What were you thinking?!

00:05:40.239 --> 00:05:41.934
Wait! Wait! Wait!
Hear me out!

00:05:42.008 --> 00:05:43.999
It wasn't me! It was HER!

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:48.344
Marionettes don't do things without
being ordered to, wise guy!

00:05:48.414 --> 00:05:49.779
Yeah! Cut the crap!

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:51.476
But SHE DOES!

00:05:52.818 --> 00:05:55.185
Hey! What're you
doing to Otaru?!

00:05:55.521 --> 00:05:59.321
What's this? Are you trying to
defy us humans, marionette?!

00:05:59.392 --> 00:06:00.723
Hold up a sec...

00:06:00.793 --> 00:06:02.887
So THAT's it!

00:06:02.962 --> 00:06:06.159
I thought it was weird for
Otaru to own a marionette!

00:06:06.232 --> 00:06:07.791
She's defective!

00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:09.335
Oh, I get it!

00:06:09.402 --> 00:06:13.737
He picked her off some trash heap
after those fire bandits blew "er up!

00:06:19.979 --> 00:06:21.538
- Let's dismantle her!
- Yeah! Yeah!

00:06:21.614 --> 00:06:23.810
It's so defective,
it thinks it's alive!

00:06:23.883 --> 00:06:25.851
Break it! Break it! Break it!

00:06:26.452 --> 00:06:28.420
Hey! Knock it off!

00:06:37.963 --> 00:06:40.227
Do you mind?
We're trying to eat!

00:06:40.399 --> 00:06:41.992
You little!

00:06:42.068 --> 00:06:44.833
How dare you treat your
human superiors this way"

00:06:45.805 --> 00:06:47.170
HEY! WE'RE TALKING TO YOU!

00:06:47.239 --> 00:06:49.503
Now, now!
Calm down, everyone!

00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:51.771
Just leave this to me.

00:06:51.844 --> 00:06:54.836
You disobedient marionette...

00:06:54.914 --> 00:06:56.973
...WILL PUNISH YOU!

00:06:57.049 --> 00:06:58.778
One, two! One, two!

00:07:00.786 --> 00:07:03.221
Hey...| can see me.

00:07:03.322 --> 00:07:05.086
Prepare to die.

00:07:12.598 --> 00:07:14.396
What're you doing, Otaru?!

00:07:14.467 --> 00:07:16.799
- Stay out of the way!!
- Yeah! Yeah!

00:07:20.339 --> 00:07:23.309
What...? What're you doing?!

00:07:23.376 --> 00:07:26.835
Have you completely lost it, Otaru?
Are you standing up for a marionette?!

00:07:26.912 --> 00:07:28.971
She's just a machine!

00:07:29.281 --> 00:07:30.476
Please!

00:07:31.884 --> 00:07:33.283
Otaru...

00:07:33.352 --> 00:07:35.411
Please... Don't break her!

00:07:37.990 --> 00:07:39.458
Please!

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.398
Have it your way.

00:07:49.235 --> 00:07:50.964
You okay, Otaru?

00:07:53.572 --> 00:07:55.802
What am I DOING?

00:07:56.842 --> 00:07:58.606
"FISH"
OTARU, YOU INCOMPETENT!

00:07:58.844 --> 00:08:01.142
You skipped out
during work yesterday!

00:08:01.213 --> 00:08:03.181
You're fired, ya hear?!
FIRED!

00:08:05.851 --> 00:08:08.343
Hey, Otaru!
Lookit! Lookit!

00:08:08.421 --> 00:08:10.549
And look over there!

00:08:11.157 --> 00:08:13.785
That old man has hair
sticking out of his nose!

00:08:15.828 --> 00:08:18.456
What's wrong, Otaru?
You're acting strange.

00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:21.591
I might have to move now...

00:08:21.667 --> 00:08:22.327
Huh?

00:08:22.401 --> 00:08:26.360
But I'd need money
to get a new apartment...

00:08:26.439 --> 00:08:29.170
| don't have the money,
and I don't have a job...

00:08:35.781 --> 00:08:37.840
I did it! He laughed!

00:08:39.819 --> 00:08:41.116
Whassis?

00:08:41.187 --> 00:08:41.997
"Japoness's Own Famous Sumida River
FIREWORKS DISPLAY"

00:08:42.021 --> 00:08:43.732
"Japoness's Own Famous Sumida River
FIREWORKS DISPLAY" Fireworks display?

00:08:43.756 --> 00:08:45.690
"Japoness's Own Famous Sumida River FIREWORKS
DISPLAY" Is it that time of year already?

00:08:46.058 --> 00:08:49.255
Hey, Otaru...
What's a "fireworks"?

00:08:49.328 --> 00:08:51.695
Oh, you know!
Fireworks are the ones...

00:08:51.764 --> 00:08:53.129
...that VROOM into the sky...

00:08:53.199 --> 00:08:54.064
...and go BOOM!

00:08:54.133 --> 00:08:57.728
...into lots of purdy reds
and blues and yellows!

00:08:57.803 --> 00:09:01.398
And when you see 'em,
you shout "OOH! AAH"

00:09:01.874 --> 00:09:03.342
Ooh. Aah.

00:09:03.876 --> 00:09:04.775
L-L-Like I said!

00:09:04.844 --> 00:09:06.812
They go VROOM! into
the sky, go BOOM!

00:09:06.879 --> 00:09:08.506
...and there's reds and
blues and yellows...

00:09:08.581 --> 00:09:10.845
...man, this is tiring.
Anyways!

00:09:10.916 --> 00:09:13.408
They're like big flowers
made of light...

00:09:13.486 --> 00:09:15.420
...that go POW at night"

00:09:16.489 --> 00:09:17.251
| wanna see!

00:09:17.323 --> 00:09:19.451
| wanna see the fireworks!
| wanna, wanna, wanna...

00:09:19.525 --> 00:09:21.425
...WANNA SEE"!

00:09:22.261 --> 00:09:25.094
Okay... I could use
a little fireworks.

00:09:25.164 --> 00:09:26.825
YAY!

00:09:26.899 --> 00:09:28.993
I love you, Otarul!!

00:09:37.776 --> 00:09:38.971
Well?

00:09:39.044 --> 00:09:41.240
We have found a store
that will suit our needs.

00:09:41.814 --> 00:09:42.781
Have you?

00:09:42.848 --> 00:09:44.475
Tonight then!

00:09:46.852 --> 00:09:48.843
"Pawn tickets exchanged here."

00:09:48.921 --> 00:09:50.912
"JOSHUYA"
Do you really, really mean it?

00:09:50.990 --> 00:09:52.958
I see!

00:09:53.425 --> 00:09:56.656
I've never heard of a comic-drummer
with so many amusing talents.

00:09:56.729 --> 00:09:59.323
Maybe I'll give you some
time off and hire him.

00:09:59.398 --> 00:10:01.765
M-Master Mitsurugi...

00:10:01.834 --> 00:10:03.302
Please don't replace me!

00:10:03.369 --> 00:10:05.736
| can't live without you! Seriously!

00:10:06.772 --> 00:10:09.707
Well, what shall we do today?

00:10:09.775 --> 00:10:12.244
I know! How about
a boat ride?

00:10:12.311 --> 00:10:14.279
Ooh! Capital idea!

00:10:14.346 --> 00:10:16.781
While we're at it, we
could pick up 2 or 3 cats...

00:10:16.849 --> 00:10:19.716
...listen to your beautiful serenade
with fine sake over the river...

00:10:19.785 --> 00:10:22.618
...and then we'll partake
of sweet sake and sushi!

00:10:23.923 --> 00:10:27.723
All right, let's head down to the
usual boat rental place and... Oh?

00:10:29.562 --> 00:10:30.893
What have we here?

00:10:30.963 --> 00:10:33.227
If it isn't Otaru!

00:10:33.299 --> 00:10:34.994
Ick! It's Hanagata.

00:10:35.067 --> 00:10:38.662
Oh, crap. We accidentally
walked in front of his place.

00:10:38.737 --> 00:10:40.967
Why all the grumbles, chap?

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:44.135
Say! How would you like
to join me for a boat ride?

00:10:44.209 --> 00:10:46.177
After all, you don't
look too busy.

00:10:49.315 --> 00:10:51.647
That's right! I heard a
minor disagreement took place...

00:10:51.717 --> 00:10:53.947
...at your apartment
complex this morning.

00:10:54.019 --> 00:10:58.354
From what I can see, her face
and figure are far from perfect...

00:10:59.058 --> 00:11:02.790
...so why are you wasting
your affection on her?

00:11:05.297 --> 00:11:07.925
Oh, hey!
Don't get me wrong, Otaru.

00:11:08.000 --> 00:11:10.697
I'm just worried about you.

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:15.236
Oh, I forgot. We're hiring for
a new bodyguard at the moment.

00:11:15.307 --> 00:11:17.537
It comes with free room
and board. What do you say?

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:25.178
It's bad enough taking that from
Otaru... but from a marionette?!

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.947
Oh, shut up!
Let's go, Lime!

00:11:28.053 --> 00:11:29.521
Coming!

00:11:32.858 --> 00:11:34.758
I'm sorry!

00:11:34.827 --> 00:11:37.125
Oh, it's a marionette.

00:11:37.196 --> 00:11:39.221
Yup! I sure am!

00:11:39.298 --> 00:11:41.198
My name's Lime!

00:11:41.667 --> 00:11:43.226
Pleased to meetcha!

00:11:44.069 --> 00:11:45.628
STOP IT™

00:11:46.238 --> 00:11:49.765
Don't you pat my brother,
you MARIONETTE!

00:11:49.842 --> 00:11:52.641
It's unclean!
Yumeji! Get inside!

00:11:52.711 --> 00:11:54.679
Go on, get going!

00:11:55.247 --> 00:11:56.510
See ya later!

00:11:56.582 --> 00:11:58.914
You will NOT see him later,
again, or hereafter!

00:11:58.984 --> 00:12:02.443
Just you try that again!
I'll reduce you to tiny pieces!

00:12:02.521 --> 00:12:04.046
Let's go.

00:12:07.326 --> 00:12:08.384
What was that?

00:12:08.460 --> 00:12:10.428
Just ignore 'im.

00:12:16.168 --> 00:12:18.500
| wonder if he hates me, too.

00:12:19.872 --> 00:12:21.237
Lime?

00:12:21.306 --> 00:12:23.274
C'mon! Let's go, Otaru!

00:12:24.643 --> 00:12:26.543
Lime...

00:12:46.598 --> 00:12:48.692
Quit shoving!
Quit shoving, you jerk"

00:12:48.767 --> 00:12:51.429
Ow! My foot!
Get of f my foot"

00:12:51.737 --> 00:12:54.138
Aw, I can't see...

00:12:54.206 --> 00:12:56.300
Stop pushing already!

00:13:05.884 --> 00:13:08.785
WHAT?! Oh, |
get it! FINE!

00:13:08.854 --> 00:13:11.619
| wouldn't want to live in the same
apartments as you clowns anyway!

00:13:11.690 --> 00:13:13.886
I'll get my things together and
leave first thing tomorrow!

00:13:13.959 --> 00:13:15.859
You happy now, bozos?!

00:13:15.928 --> 00:13:17.726
Yeah, BOZOS!

00:13:17.796 --> 00:13:20.288
- Only I get to yell.
- Oh?

00:13:20.632 --> 00:13:22.896
This sucks! Let's go, Lime.

00:13:22.968 --> 00:13:24.902
But the fireworks...

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:26.597
The fireworks...

00:13:29.842 --> 00:13:31.708
Whoa! Look at that one!

00:13:31.777 --> 00:13:33.745
Aren't they fabulous,
Master Mitsurugi?!

00:13:34.947 --> 00:13:36.415
Hanagata!

00:13:36.482 --> 00:13:38.348
Oh! If it isn't Otaru!

00:13:38.917 --> 00:13:42.512
Hey, care to join us
for a little sweet wine?

00:13:42.588 --> 00:13:45.387
There's plenty to go around!
Let's go, Lime.

00:13:45.858 --> 00:13:48.259
Aw, I missed another one...

00:14:00.839 --> 00:14:02.773
Aren't they pretty, Otaru?

00:14:02.841 --> 00:14:04.309
Yeah!

00:14:12.084 --> 00:14:13.313
"JOSHUY A"

00:14:28.267 --> 00:14:31.999
So your brother's at
home with a tummy ache?

00:14:32.371 --> 00:14:35.102
The poor little guy. I bet he
wanted to watch the fireworks, too.

00:14:35.941 --> 00:14:39.036
That's so nice! You're
such a nice guy, Otaru!

00:14:39.111 --> 00:14:41.910
That's what I like about you.

00:14:42.781 --> 00:14:44.806
W-Whatever, just give
me a little room, okay...?

00:14:44.883 --> 00:14:47.511
<i>But listen!
Just listen 'me, Otaru!</i>

00:14:47.719 --> 00:14:49.483
I know you're nice
and everything...

00:14:49.555 --> 00:14:52.923
...but ya don't hafta
be nice to a marionette!

00:14:52.991 --> 00:14:55.221
Marionettes are machines!

00:14:55.294 --> 00:14:58.229
They're not human beans, Otaruuu!

00:14:59.131 --> 00:15:01.099
More wine... I got more wine!

00:15:03.468 --> 00:15:05.232
Divine punishment!

00:15:05.304 --> 00:15:06.794
Spin, spin, spin...

00:15:06.872 --> 00:15:08.863
MASTER MITSURUGI"

00:15:08.941 --> 00:15:11.103
C-C-Come quickly!!

00:15:47.346 --> 00:15:49.542
| am Baiko, Guard
of the Imperial Court.

00:15:49.615 --> 00:15:51.413
Her partner, Tamasaburo.

00:15:51.884 --> 00:15:53.852
Were you sent by Gartlant?

00:16:01.493 --> 00:16:03.427
You won't escape.

00:16:09.968 --> 00:16:11.766
M-My house!

00:16:11.837 --> 00:16:13.862
Haw, haw!
Serves you right!

00:16:14.072 --> 00:16:16.439
Otaru! I take back
everything I just said!!

00:16:16.508 --> 00:16:18.374
You're not nice at all!

00:16:18.443 --> 00:16:20.707
Master Mitsurugi! It's horrible!!

00:16:20.779 --> 00:16:22.679
Master Yumejiis still inside!

00:16:22.748 --> 00:16:24.216
WHAT???

00:16:25.784 --> 00:16:27.752
YUMEJIIM

00:16:27.819 --> 00:16:29.981
BIG BROTHER""

00:16:32.391 --> 00:16:33.324
Dammit!

00:16:33.392 --> 00:16:34.860
Otaru?!

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:36.350
What're you doing, Hanagata?!

00:16:36.428 --> 00:16:38.522
Don't do it, Otaru!
Do you want to die?!

00:16:38.597 --> 00:16:41.498
But your brother's still
in there, you idiot!

00:16:41.566 --> 00:16:44.228
Don't! It's too late, Otaru!!

00:16:46.238 --> 00:16:49.003
But I can't just stand
here and do nothing!

00:16:49.074 --> 00:16:51.338
You'll just die too, Otaru!

00:16:51.410 --> 00:16:54.539
SHUT UP! Let go
of me, you coward!

00:16:54.613 --> 00:16:56.240
Don't do it, Otaru!!

00:16:56.782 --> 00:16:58.807
Listen to him!
We know how you feel...

00:16:58.884 --> 00:17:00.352
...but it's hopeless!

00:17:00.419 --> 00:17:02.888
If you went in now you'd
be throwing your life away.

00:17:02.955 --> 00:17:06.084
I'm sorry, but the kid
is dead by now, Otaru.

00:17:14.499 --> 00:17:15.830
Otaru...

00:17:17.836 --> 00:17:19.804
You idiot! How
can you say that?!

00:17:19.871 --> 00:17:22.738
If he's still alive, that'd
make us all murderers!

00:17:22.808 --> 00:17:24.708
Otaru! Don't!!

00:17:25.744 --> 00:17:28.213
- Lime!
- Don't worry, Otaru. I'll go.

00:17:28.547 --> 00:17:30.743
You idiot!
Don't you get it?!

00:17:30.816 --> 00:17:32.716
What if you got caught
in an explosion?!

00:17:32.784 --> 00:17:35.879
It's okay. I'm just
a machine, remember?

00:17:41.126 --> 00:17:42.594
It's okay!

00:17:45.897 --> 00:17:47.365
LIME

00:17:58.176 --> 00:18:01.510
You are spies sent by Faust,
the fuhrer of Gartlant, are you not?

00:18:04.649 --> 00:18:06.276
What are you after?

00:18:06.852 --> 00:18:08.445
Damn you!

00:18:09.454 --> 00:18:10.944
We're after--

00:18:26.838 --> 00:18:28.897
They were just ticks.

00:18:28.974 --> 00:18:31.500
We came here to
exterminate them...

00:18:31.576 --> 00:18:34.011
...for the glory of Gartlant.

00:18:34.079 --> 00:18:38.778
Fuhrer Faust sends his
deepest regards to Shogun leyasu.

00:18:39.284 --> 00:18:40.911
Who are you?

00:18:41.953 --> 00:18:43.978
We will meet again soon.

00:18:56.168 --> 00:18:57.636
Lime...

00:18:59.805 --> 00:19:01.671
Otaru...

00:19:01.940 --> 00:19:03.669
This is your fault

00:19:03.875 --> 00:19:05.775
She's dead because of you!

00:19:06.912 --> 00:19:08.880
Would you look at that!

00:19:27.999 --> 00:19:29.467
Yumejit"

00:19:31.236 --> 00:19:33.204
| got there in time, Otaru.

00:19:35.107 --> 00:19:37.701
- Big brother?!!
- Yumejiiit You're all right!

00:19:40.846 --> 00:19:42.507
Lime...!

00:19:42.881 --> 00:19:44.679
Thank goodness!

00:19:49.821 --> 00:19:51.016
By the way...

00:19:51.089 --> 00:19:52.557
Hm?

00:19:52.858 --> 00:19:55.884
How are machines
different from humans?

00:19:56.394 --> 00:19:57.384
Huh?

00:20:04.002 --> 00:20:06.869
OOH! AAH!

00:20:26.825 --> 00:20:28.520
Good morning, Otaru!

00:20:28.593 --> 00:20:29.754
Lime?

00:20:29.828 --> 00:20:32.991
It's about time you
woke up, you slacker.

00:20:33.064 --> 00:20:35.965
This is why you
can't find a job!

00:20:36.034 --> 00:20:38.025
- Right, Lime?
- RIGHT!

00:20:41.306 --> 00:20:42.796
You see, Otaru...

00:20:42.874 --> 00:20:46.310
Sometimes, the defective
things are the most loveable.

00:20:46.378 --> 00:20:47.777
Right, boys?

00:20:47.846 --> 00:20:49.644
- Hear! Hear!
- You tell 'im!

00:20:50.048 --> 00:20:52.176
She's too cute to hate!

00:20:55.387 --> 00:20:57.151
I'm defective!

00:20:57.689 --> 00:20:59.248
Stoopid.

00:20:59.324 --> 00:21:01.622
Oh! Good morning, Otaru!

00:21:01.893 --> 00:21:04.385
Hanagata! Wh-What're
YOU doing here?

00:21:06.298 --> 00:21:08.858
I'm going to be living in this
charming apartment as of today!

00:21:08.934 --> 00:21:12.632
So I just thought I'd drop you
a neighborly "HI-DEE HOY"

00:21:14.472 --> 00:21:16.099
Aw, man...

00:21:17.008 --> 00:21:18.737
C'mon, Otaru! Let's eat!

00:21:18.810 --> 00:21:20.574
C'mon, ¢'mon, ¢'mon!

00:21:20.645 --> 00:21:22.010
Oh, well.

00:21:23.148 --> 00:21:26.607
Okay, Lime. After breakfast,
let's go job hunting!

00:21:26.685 --> 00:21:27.413
Okay!

00:21:27.485 --> 00:21:29.544
Otaru! Count me in!!

00:21:29.621 --> 00:21:31.180
No bloody way.

00:21:31.256 --> 00:21:32.382
How can you say that?!

00:21:32.457 --> 00:21:34.892
- Don't be that way, ¢'mon!
- Shaddap, will ya?

00:21:34.960 --> 00:21:38.919
- Why? Why can't I come?
- Let's eat! LET'S EAT"

00:21:59.517 --> 00:22:03.147
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:03.355 --> 00:22:06.916
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:07.125 --> 00:22:09.890
Just think of me...

00:22:09.961 --> 00:22:14.660
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:14.899 --> 00:22:18.631
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:18.703 --> 00:22:22.367
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:22.540 --> 00:22:26.306
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:26.378 --> 00:22:28.073
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:28.146 --> 00:22:32.140
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:34.219 --> 00:22:36.586
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:36.655 --> 00:22:41.593
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:41.793 --> 00:22:45.320
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:45.497 --> 00:22:49.229
...one step at a time.

00:22:49.467 --> 00:22:53.165
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:53.238 --> 00:22:56.936
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:57.108 --> 00:23:00.806
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:01.012 --> 00:23:06.974
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:17.829 --> 00:23:19.422
Yoo-hoo! It's me, Lime!

00:23:19.497 --> 00:23:21.488
When me and Otaru went
to see Castle Japoness...

00:23:21.566 --> 00:23:23.762
...we got involved in
something SERIOUS!

00:23:23.835 --> 00:23:25.894
Something called a "saber
doll" came from Gartlant...

00:23:25.970 --> 00:23:28.098
...to kill the Shogun!

00:23:28.173 --> 00:23:30.039
That's when...

00:23:30.108 --> 00:23:31.405
Who are you?!

00:23:31.476 --> 00:23:33.376
What?! My ally?

00:23:33.978 --> 00:23:36.413
Next on Saber Marionette J!

00:23:36.481 --> 00:23:38.559
Big Trouble in
Castle Japoness

00:23:38.583 --> 00:23:40.950
Big Trouble in Castle
Japoness I love you, Otaru!
